					"path": "docs/welcome.md",
					"note": "Docs-adapted parent. Shared overlay is a Pi-tool-name condensation of long-horizon continuity. Local extra: denied-tool retry, parallel reads, path:line, diagnose-vs-fix. Not a prompt dump from the Electron app or CL4R1T4S."
				},
				{
					"path": "docs/agents.md",
					"note": "ZCode Agent is the only CLI-visible parent. Ask before changes, Edit automatically, and Full access are permission modes with no parent overlay."
				},
				{
					"path": "docs/agent-framework.md",
					"note": "Keep goal, files, command results, and Git state in one task."
